  ── W&B LEET: Lightweight Experiment Exploration Tool ──
  version                 0.28.2.dev1
  view                    workspace

  General
  h, ?                    Toggle this help screen
  q, ctrl+c               Quit
  alt+r                   Restart LEET
  esc                     Focus runs list
  enter                   View selected run (when not filtering/configuring)

  Panels
  1                       Toggle metrics grid
  [                       Toggle runs sidebar
  2                       Toggle system metrics panel
  ]                       Toggle run overview sidebar
  3                       Toggle media pane
  4                       Toggle console logs panel

  Navigation (focused pane)
  w/s/a/d, ↑/↓/←/→        Move within focused pane (chart focus on grids, item nav on lists)
  N, pgup                 Previous page / previous series page in media
  n, pgdown               Next page / next series page in media
  home                    Jump to first item / first page / scrub to start
  end                     Jump to last item / last page / scrub to end

  Runs
  f                       Filter runs by name / metadata
  ctrl+f                  Clear runs filter

